# SECOPS TOOLS

Registered tools for the Threat & SecOps domain:
- siem_query — query the security-event timeline for the case
  window (low risk, read-only).
- threat_hunt — search telemetry for indicators of compromise
  (elevated risk, read-only).
- detect_correlation — correlate security events into detection
  patterns (medium risk, analysis).
- incident_annotate — annotate the case incident record (action;
  step-confirm required before execution).

Execute in investigation order: query → hunt → correlate, and
only annotate the incident with analyst approval. Queries are
scoped to the case window and authorized data sources. Never
fabricate a detection, IOC, or event that the telemetry did not
return.
